the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base actionresulttype includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base actionresulttype includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/ActionResultType.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


result type annual interoperability report is identified by "http://example.org/ResultType_AnnualInteroperabilityReport".

result type annual interoperability report is an action result type.

result type annual interoperability report has the label "Annual report on interoperability in the Union".

result type annual interoperability report has the comment "A recurring report produced annually to assess interoperability progress in the European Union".


result type certificate is identified by "http://example.org/ResultType_Certificate".

result type certificate is an action result type.

result type certificate has the label "Certificate of activity".

result type certificate has the comment "A certificate provided by the competent authorities to any operator or group of operators that has notified its activity in accordance with Article 34(1) and complies with the Regulation (EU) 2018/848.".

result type certificate is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2018/848/oj/eng#art_35".


result type label of identification is identified by "http://example.org/ResultType_LabelOfIdentification".

result type label of identification is an action result type.

result type label of identification has the label "Label of Identification".

result type label of identification has the comment "A label affixed on a toy containing a type, batch, serial or model number or other element allowing their identification".

result type label of identification is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2009/48/oj/eng#art_4".


result type formal expert group is identified by "http://example.org/ResultType_FormalExpertGroup".

result type formal expert group is an action result type.

result type formal expert group has the label "Formal Expert Group".

result type formal expert group has the comment "A formal expert group, composed of representatives of all the Member States and chaired by a representative of the Commission, to advise the Commission.".

result type formal expert group is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2019/516/oj/art_4".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query places is:
    which rule is laid down in which place.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query rules_of_act is:
    which rule is established by the act which act.

query provisions is:
    which thing is established in which provision.

query joint_rules is:
    which rule is established in more than one provision.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

